    "q-109166": {
      "dom_id": "step-q109166",
      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Use Green's theorem to evaluate ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot dr,$ where $F(x,y)=⟨2x+{y}^{2},{x}^{2}+2y⟩$ and $C$ is the boundary of the region enclosed by the curve $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}$ and the lines $y=0$ and $x=3.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let $C$ be a positively oriented, piecewise-smooth, simple closed curve in the plane, and let $D$ be the region bounded by $C.$ If $P$ and $Q$ have continuous first partial derivatives on an open region containing $D$, then Green's theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ and the curve $C$ for this case are shown below.\n\n \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14223852/assets/fafd281fc63fb276c9759fd84f722096d494aa3e3fe9441f43aa6ecd1f9dfda9.png)\n\nFirst, notice that we can rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot dr={∮}_{C}(2x+{y}^{2})\\,dx+({x}^{2}+2y)\\,dy\n$$\n\nWe have that $P(x,y)=2x+{y}^{2}$ and $Q(x,y)={x}^{2}+2y.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=2y,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂x} & =2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can express the region $D$ as a type I region as follows:\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y):0\\le x\\le 3,\\,0\\le y\\le \\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}\\}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying Green's Theorem, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}(2x+{y}^{2})\\,dx+({x}^{2}+2y)\\,dy & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(2x-2y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{{x}^{2}/3}(2x-2y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{[2xy-{y}^{2}]}_{0}^{{x}^{2}/3}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}(\\frac{2{x}^{3}}{3}-\\frac{{x}^{4}}{9})dx \\\\  & ={[\\frac{{x}^{4}}{6}-\\frac{{x}^{5}}{45}]}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{(3)^{4}}{6}-\\frac{(3)^{5}}{45} \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{2}-\\frac{27}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{81}{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-109166-a",
